desc(
	mode: "source",
	language: "general",
	title: "Use Assert Class",
	title_zh: "检测到Use Assert Class",
	type: vuln,
	level: middle,
	rule_id: "source-insecure-api-use-assert-class",
	risk: "Best-Practice",
	desc: <<<DESC
Migrated from Semgrep rule `use-assert-class` (/tmp/semgrep-rules/apex/lang/best-practice/ncino/tests/UseAssertClass.yaml).
Original message: Assert methods in the System class have been replaced with the Assert class: https://developer.salesforce.com/docs/atlas.en-us.apexref.meta/apexref/apex_class_System_Assert.htm

CWE: -
References:
- https://developer.salesforce.com/docs/atlas.en-us.apexref.meta/apexref/apex_class_System_Assert.htm
DESC,
	solution: <<<SOLUTION
Follow the framework's secure configuration guidance; remove or replace the flagged pattern.
SOLUTION,
	alert_min: 1,
	"file://pos.cls": <<<POS
System.assert

POS,
	"safefile://neg.sample": <<<NEG
# safe sample
no secrets here
just regular code
NEG,
)

${*.cls}.pattern_regex(/System\.assert/) as $p0
${UseAssertClass.cls}.pattern_regex(/System\.assert/) as $p1
$p0 + $p1 as $hit
alert $hit for {
	level: "middle",
	title: "Use Assert Class",
	title_zh: "检测到Use Assert Class",
	message: "Use Assert Class",
}
